  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "This genus-level Psittacosaurus has a short deep beak, cheek projections and a localized tail-bristle region. The reference fossil is not securely assigned to a species; body thickness, colour and complete bristle lengths remain estimates.",
    "zh": "此属级鹦鹉嘴龙 Psittacosaurus 具有短而深的喙、颊部突起和尾部局部鬃毛区。参考化石不能可靠归入具体种；体厚、颜色及鬃毛完整长度仍为估计。"
